rs, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"NIpZBy1O1JFj9x2bcErZlQ","review_id":"_K_iy_NUYgyUEo9qLwlq5g","date":"2012-10-01T01:53:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9340702295303345,"text_excerpt":"I absolutely love Finn's, such an amazing place. Pauline and Steve are just awesome people and you can't help but to feel welcomed and at home there. It's the best bar in the city to be in on Sundays for game day, weather the Saints win or lose, you're guarantee to have a blast here! Plus there are always some hotties in the place, makes for a nice environment. Everyone wins at Finn's!"},{"business_id":"NIpZBy1O1JFj9x2bcErZlQ","review_id":"dYh0ohd8dgYPRob_HvMfQA","date":"2013-04-28T00:47:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9326399564743042,"text_excerpt":"To call this place a bar is to not do it justice. It is more like a community center, I wish I lived closer to it. The best bar to watch football (American and not American). They have free food during Saints game and an incredible atmosphere to watch in. If you're a soccer fan you have to come early on a Saturday morning during the EPL season, you won't have to experience the shame of drinking alone at 8am (it's 5 o'clock somewhere right?) Bonus: Boo Koo BBQ is inside Finn McCool's and is very good. Ipso facto, Finn McCool's has really good food."},{"business_id":"NIpZBy1O1JFj9x2bcErZlQ","review_id":"BUCsUZ65QC1Z9JLUWUskGw","date":"2015-08-14T15:31:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9293761253356934,"text_excerpt":"Came here for St. Patrick's Day. Very fun atmosphere! They throw really good parties with karaoke and games. The food is good as well. Last time I came I got a breakfast sandwich/hot pocket and it was delish! The servers are really friendly and I would say it is a great neighborhood bar!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"NIpZBy1O1JFj9x2bcErZlQ","photo_id":"jTpI1mY8NMHscbz_FDT3ug","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jTpI1mY8NMHscbz_FDT3ug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9046991467475891},{"business_id":"NIpZBy1O1JFj9x2bcErZlQ","photo_id":"8V0KBYTrBSSjeSbmL1dt3w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/8V0KBYTrBSSjeSbmL1dt3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8946993947029114},{"business_id":"NIpZBy1O1JFj9x2bcErZlQ","photo_id":"adf0S1x1luXnDRi-01MFCQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/adf0S1x1luXnDRi-01MFCQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8572773933410645},{"business_id":"NIpZBy1O1JFj9x2bcErZlQ","photo_id":"d1PMbsK50mp5PmuyEt2ovA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/d1PMbsK50mp5PmuyEt2ovA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8180173635482788},{"business_id":"NIpZBy1O1JFj9x2bcErZlQ","photo_id":"jWpcx-UvU0SaWt37ZRWacA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jWpcx-UvU0SaWt37ZRWacA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6892561912536621}]},"notebook_case":null}
